Package: wine-sg
Architecture: amd64
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Provides: wine-sg-wow64
Description: Wine for Stained Glass OS, with 32-bit support on pure amd64
 Wine built with --enable-archs=i386,x86_64 ("new WoW64"), so a single amd64
 installation runs both 64-bit and 32-bit Windows applications without any
 i386 Linux libraries and without enabling i386 multiarch.
 .
 Neither Debian's nor WineHQ's packaged Wine is built this way: both ship the
 WoW64 thunk DLLs in their amd64 package while keeping the 32-bit PE set in a
 separate i386 package, so an amd64-only install appears capable and then
 cannot run 32-bit Windows binaries.
 .
 Installs under /opt/wine-sg and does not conflict with a distribution Wine.
